erratum the row this lap booked was renumbered when it landed on 20260908.191521 -- it was booked from a local read while this log sat parked in a round-open stash, and by the time it landed the anointed spine had spent that number on another stamp. The stamp above is the key and has not moved; the shelf paths in the file fields below are the renamed ones.
scope one red closed with a witness on metal, its control widened and pressed both ways; the main.rye port surveyed and left for the next lap
status GREEN -- crushed_index, reds_spine_derive, reds_ledger_monotone, reds_citation, unshared_citation, fold_shelf_link all green on metal; hot roster run before the send
recommend keep-going -- the next lap opens on the mantra/src/main.rye port: import weave.rye and diff.rye, delete the inlined Line/Diff/Weave and compute_diff, seam the store through from_v1/to_v1, and lower mantra_weave_model's ceiling 2 -> 1
